# Reach's own R8 keep rules (AGP passes every file in src/main/keepRules to R8). D69.
#
# Most of what must survive needs no rule here:
# - Manifest components (MainActivity, ReachApplication, ReachNotificationListenerService,
#   ReachAccessibilityService) are kept by the rules AAPT generates from the merged manifest.
# - Hilt, Room, DataStore, Compose, coroutines and AndroidX ship consumer keep rules in their
#   AARs; Hilt and Room generate code instead of using reflection on our classes.
# - The hidden-API notification-shade fallback reflects on a *framework* class
#   (StatusBarManager), which R8 never sees or renames, so it needs no rule either.
#
# Kept: line numbers in stack traces (crash reports from testers stay readable after
# obfuscation; the mapping file is in app/build/outputs/mapping/release/).
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
